# The Loom cards the 1bit OS payload carries (stage-loom.sh), each pinned to a revision with every file's sha256 and
# size. A card is its programs and metadata (under its own licence: os/licenses/loom-cards/SOURCE); its weights are NOT here: the card's own
# model.json.lock names them, the catalogue pulls them into Lemonade's Hugging Face cache, and 1bit-loom-cards links
# the card's parameter/ files there at boot (engine#3350 rc1, orchestrator 23 Nov).
#
# card <directory name> <hf repo> <revision>, then that card's files: <sha256> <size> <path>
